Phone Compute Offload is an original implementation.

It does not contain source code from:

- RAPID (RapidProjectH2020/rapid-android-DemoApp) — no repository license
- Libdroid (CGCL-codes/Libdroid) — no repository license; FaceDetect sample is GPL-3.0
- Icecream (icecc/icecream) — GPL-2.0-only
- LambDa (luckiday/LambDa) — MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 Q_G

Those projects were read for architecture only. Design notes live outside
this repository, in the author's research directory. LambDa's MIT license
would allow copying with attribution; the framed transfer used here was
written from scratch because the original metadata read is not reliable on
a TCP stream.
